Tom Leitner  <tom@radar.tu-graz.ac.at> wrote:
> Mike DuFresne <v_due@mindspring.com> wrote:
> > I have been looking for a video adapter for Tru64 v5. So far ther have
> > been two reccomendations, either a Diamond FireGL 1000 Pro or an Elsa
> > Gloria Synergy. Unfortunately those two cards both appear to be
> > discontinued  and/or unavailable in PCI format.
> 
> > I have been offered a 3DLabs Oxygen ACX as a possible replacement. I am
> > wondering though, is it enough for the card to be Permedia2 based in
> > order to be supported by Tru64, or are there other hardware issues(
> > bios, et al).
