more times than none the main reason asemgr fails to relocate a service is
because it can't "stop the service".  This means that it cannot unmount all the
/var/ase/mnt/* filesystems.  Try to unmount them manually.  Once you figure
that out, asemgr should be able to stop the service and relocate.



