Hans Vansweevelt (Hans.Vansweevelt@chem.kuleuven.ac.be) wrote:

: /sbin/loader: Fatal Error: cannot map libfor.so
: We are using a queueing system (NQS) and in some queues the error
: pccured and not in others, for the same program.

You are running into a resource limitation. Two most likely candidates
are the maximum per-process data size and virtual address space size.
The only remedy would be to increase the limits (and, possibly, add
memory and/or swap space to support the increased limits).

/Serge.P

