You need to rebuild the kernel.  The Vga device will not support the
resolution and color depth set on the card.  Hence the Xserver fails.  If
you replaced a previous vga card with the new Powerstorm card, then that
explains the vga0 device entry.  The Powerstorm controller should be a tga
device (controller tga0).  Edit your configuration and rebuild.  Verify the
bus and slot info as well.

JET

