>dtgreet seem to show up. However, the login screen never appears, the
>processes on the server side die, and Xerrors file has the following
>output:
>

It could be that dtlogin is unable to "grab" the X display.
Copy /usr/dt/config/Xconfig to /etc/dt/config/Xconfig, then
edit the latter file to read:

Dtlogin*grabServer:        False

Finally, send the HUP signal to the main dtlogin process.




