Is that a typo? Do you mean `CC=cc' instead?

> Stumped!  What hack do I try next?  

Do a `make distclean', or at least remove any Makefiles and config.cache
files, and then try again.

If you're going to build more than just the stage1 compiler, you may be
wasting your time doing any optimizing.  You want the stage2 (and stage3)
compiler to be optimized, but it doesn't really matter if the stage1 compiler
is optimized.

